        },
        "description": "(first appearance), 23 (now)\n__Height:__ 173 cm (5'8\")\n__Occupation:__ Magi, Magician, Oracle\n__Affiliation:__ Al-Thamen (former), Kou Empire (now)\n\nJudar is one of the four Magi in the current era and a Magician who specializes in Ice Magic. He is the former Oracle of Al-Thamen and the Kou Empire after siding with Hakuryuu to aid him in taking over Kou Empire. According to Hakuryuu Ren, the name \"Judar\" was given by Al-Thamen, and his real name is unknown. He is the one of the main antagonist of the series. \"Judar\" in arabic means argument, debate, controversy.  \n\n(Source: Magi Wikia)",
        "gender": null,
        "age": "18"
      },
      "voiceActors": []
    },
